  "Session-briefing evals (C2b). Run: OPENROUTER_API_KEY=... python3 coach/evals/run_briefing_evals.py",
  "Each scenario is the facts the server would send (companion/coach/briefing.py facts_for) and code-checked rules on the",
  "TEMPLATE the coach writes. No LLM judge: every check is a regex or a word list, so a pass is reproducible.",
  "slots            the slots the facts back (the validator rejects any other, any digit, number word, x/km/bpm/HR/Z2, dash, 41+ words)",
  "kind             easy | long | quality",
  "named            True when the plan names the session (the {session} slot exists)",
  "first_any        the FIRST sentence must contain one of these (case-insensitive): the kind is named up front",
  "pacing_any       somewhere in the briefing at least one of these: how to tackle it, matching the kind",
  "must_all         every one of these must appear (warm-up rules that must survive)",
  "never            none of these regexes may match (easy never with push; no medical advice; no niggle talk)",
  "expect: none     no briefing is written at all (safety); checked offline against the server's blocking flags"
 ],
